            "type": "text",
            "text": " dishcloth is 25 x 25 cm. Five-treble shells sit in the dc spaces between each previous row's shells. The scalloped edges appear on all four sides when the edging is worked in the round."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DK cotton on a 4 mm hook. Total yarn needed is around 45 m."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
